{"id":"f45b10da3a0836ed","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-wadge-order.md","title":"ZFC Wadge Order","display":"df-zfc-wadge-order — ZFC Wadge Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-wadge-order","aliases":["58-df-zfc-wadge-order"],"display":"df-zfc-wadge-order — ZFC Wadge Order","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-wadge-reduction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-wadge-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-wadge-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-wadge-order — ZFC Wadge Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"67ec9d5a33dd0df2\" href=\"?note=67ec9d5a33dd0df2\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-wadge-reduction.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-wadge-reduction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(A,B,X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3WadgeReduction}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3WadgeReduction}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WadgeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{WadgeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}wadge\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\mathrm{WadgeOrder}_S(A,B,X,\\tau) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A,B\\subseteq X\\land\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3WadgeReduction}_S(X,X,\\tau,\\tau,A,B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}wadge\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\mathrm{WadgeOrder}_S(A,B,X,\\tau) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A,B\\subseteq X\\land\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3WadgeReduction}_S(X,X,\\tau,\\tau,A,B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\leq_W B\">\\(A\\leq_W B\\)</span> 当且仅当存在连续自映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\to X\">\\(f:X\\to X\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=f^{-1}[B]\">\\(A=f^{-1}[B]\\)</span>；这给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> 上的预序。</li>\n<li>集合载体和拓扑条件被显式加入，避免把不属于同一空间的任意集合送入 Wadge 归约谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-wadge-reduction.md","status":"resolved","id":"67ec9d5a33dd0df2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-wadge-reduction.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3WadgeReduction}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WadgeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}wadge\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\mathrm{WadgeOrder}_S(A,B,X,\\tau) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A,B\\subseteq X\\land\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3WadgeReduction}_S(X,X,\\tau,\\tau,A,B)","display":true},{"tex":"A\\leq_W B","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"A=f^{-1}[B]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(X)","display":false}],"bytes":1052,"backlinks":[{"id":"6f115f36c35aafb7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WadgeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-wadge-order.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3862","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-wadge-order.md|58-df-zfc-wadge-order]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","74086485fba8d86f","67ec9d5a33dd0df2"]}